      "max_lead_min": null,
      "doneness_cue": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Maida, suji, namak, cheeni, baking soda/meetha soda ko ek bowl me milayein; beech me kuaan bana kar dahi daal kar dough gundhein aur paani se adjust karke thoda tight lekin smooth dough banayein.",
      "label": "Make dough",
