      "text": "Pressure cooker garam kar ke 2 tbsp oil daal kar whole spices (Black Elaichi, Dalchini, Cloves, Green Cardamom, Kali Mirch) tadka lagayein; phir onion-anardana paste daal kar 1 minute bhune (transcript: \"ek minute\") aur ginger garlic paste 1/2 tsp daal kar bhun lein.",
